title: Choosing Our Enemies
new-page: true
view-if: b_enemies_timer <= 0
on-arrival: b_enemies_timer = 6; week_actions += 1
is-card: true
card-image: img/soviet_leaders.jpg
tags: b_party

= Choosing Our Enemies

In our media and campaign materials, who should we focus our attention on?

- @bourgeois
- @counterrevolutionaries
- @bourgeois_intellectuals
- @profiteers
- @vermin
- @clergy
- @germans
- @imperialists
- @mensheviks
- @concilators
- @defencists
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@bourgeois
title: The burzhooi, the rich, and their hangers-on. 
on-arrival: capital_flight += 0.5; leftcom_strength += 1*(1-b_dissent); leninist_strength += 2*(1-b_dissent); k_relation -= 1; rightist_relation -= 5; instability += 1; elite_unrest += 5; middle_unrest += 2.5; kulak_unrest += 2.5; intelligentsia_unrest += 1; bourgeois_specialist_unrest += 5; labor_unrest -= 5; peasant_unrest -= 5; underclass_unrest -= 5; provincial_unrest -= 5; provincial_strength += 5; 


Attacking the old capitalists elites or their lackeys is certainly popular among our base. 


@counterrevolutionaries
title: Counterrevolutionaries, reactionaries, [? if white_movement_seen = 1 : White-Guardists, ?] and Black Hundreds.
on-arrival: k_relation -= 1; rightist_relation -= 2; instability += 2; capital_flight += 0.125; elite_unrest += 5; intelligentsia_unrest += 1; bourgeois_specialist_unrest += 2; labor_unrest -= 4; peasant_unrest -= 2; underclass_unrest -= 2; redarmy_unrest -= 5; provincial_unrest -= 2; provincial_strength += 2; soldiers_unrest -= 5; 

Decrying the threat of counterrevolutionary forces is a powerful rallying cry. 


@bourgeois_intellectuals
title: The bourgeois intellectuals, elitists, and old society types. 
on-arrival: k_relation -= 1; rightist_relation -= 3; leftcom_strength += 1*(1-b_dissent); intelligentsia_unrest += 5; bourgeois_specialist_unrest += 10; bourgeois_specialists_strength -= 5; bourgeois_specialists = (bourgeois_specialists * 0.95); capital_flight += 0.125; red_specialist_unrest -= 5; red_specialist_strength += 5; labor_unrest -= 4; peasant_unrest -= 2; underclass_unrest -= 2;

Attacking the intelligentsia destabilizes pre-existing institutions, though it satisfies many rising progressives and radicals. 


@vermin
title: The vermin, parasites, idlers, and hooligans. 
on-arrival: food_production = (food_production * (1 - ((60/50)*0.03))); leftcom_strength += 1*(1-b_dissent); leninist_strength += 2*(1-b_dissent); instability += 3; elite_unrest += 2.5; middle_unrest += 2.5; kulak_unrest += 2.5; intelligentsia_unrest += 2; bourgeois_specialist_unrest += 5; labor_unrest -= 5; peasant_unrest -= 8; underclass_unrest += 5;  underclass_strength -= 5; provincial_unrest -= 8; provincial_strength += 8; union_unrest += 3; 

Such rhetoric intensifies conflict in the countryside, which our provincial forces and supporters take advantage of.  

@profiteers
title: The profiteers, [? if bagmen_active = 1 : bagmen, ?], kulaks, and petty-bourgeois looters. 
on-arrival: food_production = (food_production * (1 - ((60/50)*0.04))); food_sold = (food_sold * 0.95); leftcom_strength += 1*(1-b_dissent); leninist_strength += 4*(1-b_dissent); instability += 3; crime += 5; middle_unrest += 5; middle_strength -= 2; kulak_unrest += 8; intelligentsia_unrest += 1; labor_unrest -= 4; peasant_unrest -= 5; underclass_unrest -= 2; kulak_strength -= 2; soldiers_unrest -= 3; soldiers_unrest += 7 if bagmen_active = 1; bagmen_unrest += 5; bagmen_strength -= 5; underclass_strength -= 2; provincial_strength += 3; union_unrest -= 3; union_strength += 2.5; 


Such rhetoric reinvigorates our base, though exacerbates tensions with small business owners, wealthier peasants, 

@clergy
title: The clergy, the obscurantists, and their superstitions. 
on-arrival: leftcom_strength += 3*(1-b_dissent); leninist_strength += 5*(1-b_dissent); instability += 2; clergy_unrest += 10; clergy_strength -= (5*(1 - b_dissent)); intelligentsia_unrest -= 5; bourgeois_specialist_unrest += 3; red_specialist_unrest -= 2; labor_unrest -= 2; 

Attacking Russia's old religious institutions is popular among our base, though polarizing for most others. 

@germans
title: The German warmongers, and their saboteurs and spies. 
on-arrival: leftcom_strength += 8*(1-b_dissent); leninist_strength += 1*(1-b_dissent); instability += 1; labor_unrest -= 3; peasant_unrest -= 3; underclass_unrest -= 3; germany_relation -= 10; austria_relation -= 2; ottoman_relation -= 2; uk_relation += 5; france_relation += 5; war_weariness += 2;

Attacking the German invaders resonates well with most everyday people. 

@imperialists
title: The imperialist powers - Britain and France primarily.
on-arrival: leftcom_strength += 4*(1-b_dissent); leninist_strength += 3*(1-b_dissent); labor_unrest -= 3; peasant_unrest -= 3; underclass_unrest -= 3; uk_relation -= 10; france_relation -= 10; war_weariness += 2; soldiers_unrest -= 5; 

Attacking the foreign imperialists appeals to our base, and all those exhausted of continued war. 


@mensheviks
title: Mensheviks, SRs, and all "socialists" in the service of the bourgeoisie.  
on-arrival: sdi_relation -= 2; left_m_relation -= 5; centre_m_relation -= 5; right_m_relation -= 5; centre_sr_relation -= 5; right_sr_relation -= 5; ns_relation -= 5; k_relation -= 2; rightist_relation -= 2; sdi_strength -= ((1+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (sdi_strength / 50)); left_m_strength -= ((2+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (left_m_strength / 50)); centre_m_strength -= ((2+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (centre_m_strength / 50)); right_m_strength -= ((2+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (right_m_strength / 50)); centre_sr_strength -= ((2+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (centre_sr_strength / 50)); right_sr_strength -= ((2+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (right_sr_strength / 50)); ns_strength -= ((2+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (ns_strength / 50)); 


Attacking the other socialist parties reduces their standing among the working class and the soldiers.


@concilators
title: Conciliators, compromisers, and collaborators. 
on-arrival: moderate_dissent += 6; moderate_strength -= 3; leftcom_strength += 2*(1-b_dissent); leninist_strength += 6*(1-b_dissent); sdi_relation -= 5; left_m_relation -= 5; centre_m_relation -= 2; right_m_relation -= 2; lsr_relation -= 5; centre_sr_relation -= 2; right_sr_relation -= 2; ns_relation -= 5; k_relation -= 2; rightist_relation -= 2; sdi_strength -= ((2+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (sdi_strength / 50)); left_m_strength -= ((2+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (left_m_strength / 50)); centre_m_strength -= ((1+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (centre_m_strength / 50)); right_m_strength -= ((0+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (right_m_strength / 50)); centre_sr_strength -= ((1+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (centre_sr_strength / 50)); right_sr_strength -= ((0+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (right_sr_strength / 50)); ns_strength -= ((0+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (ns_strength / 50)); 


Attacking the prospects of compromise with other groups galvanizes our primary base, though hurting our standing with all moderate forces. 

@defencists
title: Defencists, patriots, and expansionists. 
on-arrival: leftcom_strength += 4*(1-b_dissent); leninist_strength += 2*(1-b_dissent); soldiers_unrest -= 6; labor_unrest -= 3; peasant_unrest -= 3; underclass_unrest -= 3; uk_relation += 2; france_relation += 2; war_weariness += 4; sdi_relation += 5; left_m_relation += 5; centre_m_relation -= 2; right_m_relation -= 5; lsr_relation += 5; centre_sr_relation -= 2; right_sr_relation -= 5; ns_relation -= 5; k_relation -= 5; rightist_relation -= 5; centre_m_strength -= ((1+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (centre_m_strength / 50)); right_m_strength -= ((2+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (right_m_strength / 50)); centre_sr_strength -= ((1+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (centre_sr_strength / 50)); right_sr_strength -= ((2+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (right_sr_strength / 50)); ns_strength -= ((2+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (ns_strength / 50)); k_strength -= ((0+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (k_strength / 50)); rightist_strength -= ((0+b_workers_org)*(1-b_dissent) - (rightist_strength / 50)); 


Attacking the proponents of imperialist war angers the right-wings of the various parties, though fellow internationalists welcome this. 
